  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing HIV &amp; AIDS Epidemic Control Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the education for south sudan advancing hiv &amp; aids epidemic control (AHEC) activity is to decrease morbidity and mortality among south sudanese by increasing prevention, care, treatment, and retention services for at-risk men and women.</narrative>
